  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-finance PPP, LRF/ETKL - COFINANCE PPP, LRF/ETKL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samfinans PPP-ETKL/LRF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A cooperation between the Swedish Farmers Assistance and the Estonian Farmers Union with the aim to establish ETKL-Naised as the national representative for Estonian rural women, to develop a self-financed information system and to give the members and elected members of ETKLNaised knowledge in organisation, personal development and EU-integra.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett samarbete mellan LRF, Sveriges b&#xF6;nder hj&#xE4;lper, och &quot;the Estonian Farmers Union&quot; med syfte att etablera ETKL-Naised som nationell representant f&#xF6;r Estlands lantbrukarkvinnor, att utveckla ett sj&#xE4;lvfinansierat informationssystem och att ge ETKLs medlemmar kunskapi organisation, personlig utveckling, kooperation och EU-integration.</narrative>
  </description>
